# Evolve (CR 702.100a) and defender (CR 702.3a): Clinging Anemones is a 1/4 defender. Elite Vanguard (2/1) has greater power only,
# so evolve triggers and the Anemones are 2/5. On turn 3 Elite Vanguard may attack and the Anemones, having defender, may
# not. Black Lotus (three blue) and Mox Sapphire pay for the Anemones' {3}{U}, Mox Pearl for the Vanguard.

